<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>活動登記已結束 / Registration Closed</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300,400,500,700&display=swap" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }
        .title-container {
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .title-container h1,
        .title-container h2 {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">
<div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-12" style="display: -webkit-flex; display: flex; -webkit-align-items: center; align-items: center; -webkit-justify-content: center; justify-content: center;">
    <div class="max-w-5xl w-full" style="width: 100%; max-width: 80rem;">
        <!-- Banner -->
        <div class="mb-8 rounded-t-lg overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/images/banner.jpg" alt="Banner" class="w-full h-auto">
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8 md:p-12">
            <!-- Event Title -->
            <div class="mb-8 title-container">
                <h1 class="text-lg md:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;">
                    香港賽馬會呈獻：「馬到功成耀香江」馬年煙花匯演
                </h1>
                <h2 class="text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed" style="text-align: center;">
                    The Hong Kong Jockey Club Presents: "Prosperity Gallops Across Hong Kong" Year of the Horse Fireworks Display
                </h2>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Chinese Section -->
            <div class="mb-6">
                <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded">
                    <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-3">
                        活動登記已圓滿結束，衷心感謝大家的支持！
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                        如有任何查詢，歡迎致電 
                        <a href="tel:+85221144945" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline font-semibold">
                            +852 2114 4945
                        </a>
                        與我們聯絡。
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Divider -->
            <div class="border-t-2 border-gray-300 my-6"></div>

            <!-- English Section -->
            <div>
                <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded">
                    <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-3">
                        Guest registration for the event has successfully concluded. We sincerely appreciate your support.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                        For any inquiries, please contact us at 
                        <a href="tel:+85221144945" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline font-semibold">
                            +852 2114 4945
                        </a>.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
